> ## Protocol
> 
> All requests follow the [JSON-RPC 2.0](https://www.jsonrpc.org/specification) specification:
> 
> ```json
> {
>   "jsonrpc": "2.0",
>   "id": 1,
>   "method": "<method_name>",
>   "params": { ... }
> }
> ```
